questions=[('What dates can actually be used?','User supplied 15–18 Feb preference inside 15 Feb–23 Mar 2027 range. Three nights do not meet seven-night comparison.','Use 15–22 Feb as a proposal only; check travel-day boundaries before any non-refundable purchase.',['pen-offer']),('What is the total budget for two?','Not supplied. Only one hotel price calculation and four published restaurant-menu totals are usable.','Obtain a ceiling before choosing a luxury anchor; do not represent partial costs as a full-trip total.',['rate-0','tang-menu','bao-menu']),('Which passports and entry permission?','Nationality, passport expiry, residence and routing are not supplied. No visa or transit exemption claimed.','Check the appropriate Chinese consulate / National Immigration Administration against actual traveler documents and 2027 dates; do not infer nationality from location.',['east']),('Where are flights starting, and when do they land?','Departure airport, flight budget and arrival/departure times unknown.','Obtain official airline schedules and dated fares after the city/date scenario is settled. Do not equate hotel check-in with departure from home.',['rate-0']),('Are the bed and bathroom requirements met?','King options and bathroom fixtures documented; explicit privacy and some occupancy facts unresolved.','Request room-level confirmation from each hotel; preserve it with the dated quote.',['langham-room','pen-room','marriott-room','bvlgari-room']),('How much walking is comfortable?','No walking limit, mobility requirement or maximum transfer count supplied.','Define door-to-door transit assumptions before ranking; then check exact subway/bus routes at meal times.',['history']),('Any allergies or dietary restrictions?','Unknown. Vegetarian cuisine is not proof of allergy safety.','Confirm requirements and cross-contact arrangements with the operator before a fixed tasting menu.',['tang','fu','taian-menu']),('Is a non-refundable rate acceptable?','Not supplied. Peninsula’s sampled offer requires full prepayment and no amendments.','Compare genuinely refundable alternatives with a documented cancellation deadline; no booking without authorization.',['pen-offer']),('Which attractions take priority?','No specific activity list supplied; five are researched proposals.','Use the existing outline as a low-commitment starting point. Confirm date-valid schedules before deciding between alternatives.',['east','west','yu','bund']),('Is Shanghai the right base?','Shanghai selected as a research scope; Guangzhou guide coverage also checked. Not an exhaustive city comparison.','Expand city/hotel research only if itinerary, budget or culinary preference makes that worthwhile.',['michelin-sh','michelin-gz'])]
suggestions=[('S01','Highest impact','Add a reproducible quote collector','Capture exact room, two-adult occupancy, taxes, refund deadline and retrieval time. Compare all 30 eligible seven-night start dates.','Needs a permitted way to render booking engines. Never bypass access controls or make a booking.','F02'),('S02','Highest impact','Build the transit evidence matrix','Store both directions, meal time, walking legs, waits and transfers for each hotel/venue pair. Only count routes with confirmed total ≤60 minutes.','Official timetable/route evidence is required. A map pin or straight-line radius is not enough.','F01'),('S03','High impact','Separate stable facts from live facts','Keep addresses and room features distinct from rates, menus and hours; attach per-field evidence and recheck rules.','Current source register is a baseline; automatic stale-data alerts are proposed, not running.','F10'),('S04','High impact','Add a complete cost comparison','Include flights, lodging, all meals, transport, admissions and entry costs. Show known subtotal separately from unknown balance.','Cannot responsibly produce a total until missing categories have real quotes.','F13'),('S05','Medium impact','Expand the exact-branch media library','Match each clip to venue address; record language, creator and publication date. Prefer operator-linked accounts.','Historic footage must never update current award or price fields.','F08'),('S06','Medium impact','Add a second-city scenario','Research Guangzhou hotels and dated costs as a separate scenario, not a presumed cheaper alternative.','Additional city research should not mix Guangzhou/Shenzhen totals or borrow Shanghai transit assumptions.','F02')]
decisions=panel('A considered starting point','<div class="recommend-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">PROPOSED PATH</span><h3>Shanghai · one hotel · seven nights</h3><p>Keep 15–22 February as the working scenario. Use the Peninsula quote as a cost anchor, investigate Marriott as a price challenger, and retain Langham for Xintiandi dining. None is a confirmed best-value or eligible winner yet.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT NOT TO DO</span><h3>Do not buy certainty you do not have.</h3><p>A non-refundable promotion is not a reason to overlook entry permission, private-bathroom confirmation, budget or transit limits. This site has made no booking and created no traveler accounts.</p></div></div>')+table(['Question before a decision','Answer from current information','How to discover the missing information','Official context'],[([q,a,step,refs(sr)],'') for q,a,step,sr in questions],caption='Decision checklist · personal unknowns cannot be researched or guessed away')+panel('Destination comparison: guide coverage, not value',table(['Destination','Official 2026 coverage','Interpretation','Official source'],[(['Shanghai','156 guide restaurants · 51 starred (1 three-star + 12 two-star + 38 one-star)','Detailed scope here. More guide entries alone do not prove a cheaper or more convenient holiday.',refs(['michelin-sh'])],''),(['Guangzhou','117 guide restaurants · 20 starred','A valid dining alternative; hotels, activity plans and date-specific costs not researched here.',refs(['michelin-gz'])],'')],caption='Two destinations considered · not a complete survey of China'))+f'<section class="panel" id="suggestions"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SUGGESTIONS · REVIEW BEFORE IMPLEMENTATION</span><h2>Improve the next decision, not just the screen.</h2></div><button id="export-decisions" class="button secondary">Export review choices ↓</button></div><p>All enhancements below are proposals. Optional selections are saved only in this browser; they do not authorize work, change research data, or make reservations. Nothing needs to be entered to use the site.</p><div class="suggestion-grid">'+''.join(f'<article class="suggestion" id="{sid}"><div>{tag(priority,"green")}<span class="suggestion-id">{sid}</span></div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p><small>{dependency}</small><a href="review.html#{flag}">Related evidence gap: {flag} →</a><div class="review-actions" data-suggestion="{sid}"><button data-choice="consider" aria-pressed="false">Consider</button><button data-choice="defer" aria-pressed="false">Defer</button><span aria-live="polite">Not reviewed</span></div></article>' for sid,priority,title,body,dependency,flag in suggestions)+'</div><p id="storage-note" class="fineprint">Local review choices are optional and are not shared with anyone.</p></section>'

sourcerows=[]
for s in S.values():
    sourcerows.append(([f'<strong>{e(s["id"])}</strong>'+tag('Official source' if s['kind']=='official' else 'Media / inspiration','green' if s['kind']=='official' else 'neutral'),link(s['url'],s['title']),e(s['evidence']),f'{e(s["checked"])}<small>{e(s["method"])}</small>',e(s['note'])],f'id="source-{s["id"]}" data-searchable="{e(s["title"]+" "+s["id"]+" "+s["evidence"])}" data-category="{s["kind"]}"'))
sources=panel('What “verified” means here','<div class="method-grid"><div><h3>Official facts</h3><p>Hotel and restaurant operators support room, menu and rate facts. MICHELIN supports its own awards and published listings. Museum and government visitor pages support their stated schedules. The registry records the exact claim checked—not a blanket endorsement of every fact on a page.</p></div><div><h3>Calculated, not invented</h3><p>Hotel totals multiply a sourced nightly input by seven and apply an explicitly published surcharge. Two-person menu totals use sourced set prices or multiplication by two. Arithmetic is labeled; a calculated amount is not a final checkout quote.</p></div><div><h3>Unknown stays unknown</h3><p>Null means not confirmed. It is displayed as a blank value with a visible reason, never as zero, “free,” “closed,” or “sold out.” No travel duration is estimated. Current facts are not presented as guaranteed in 2027.</p></div><div><h3>Media is separate</h3><p>Social links are labeled as fetched, operator-linked or discovery-only. They are not used for official prices, awards or hours. Missing exact-branch matches stay flagged. Links may require login or stop working after this snapshot.</p></div></div>')+f'<div class="download-strip"><div><strong>Take the research with you.</strong><small>Machine-readable data, original brief and audit notes.</small></div>{link("data/trip.json","Data JSON ↓","button secondary")}{link("data/hotels.csv","Hotel CSV ↓","button secondary")}{link("research/verification.md","Audit notes ↗","button secondary")}</div>'+toolbar('source-table','Search source, venue or evidence',[('all','All sources'),('official','Official only'),('media','Media only')])+table(['Evidence ID','Source link','Checked claim / excerpt summary','Checked / method','Limitations'],sourcerows,'source-table','Source register · paraphrased checked evidence, not a complete archive of external pages')

